      en: ["The mountain reaches a peak elevation of 847 meters.", "Over 40,000 ancient petroglyphs have been found on the mountain.", "Most archaeological findings date to the Early Bronze Age.", "Emmanuel Anati identified the site as a possible Mount Sinai in 1983.", "The mountain is located within an Israeli military firing zone.", "The plateau contains remains of a sanctuary from the Paleolithic era."],
